# spec_id: eravos.wub-sub · version 1.0.0 · status built · template eravos.tool/1 (sound flavour)
identity:
  id: eravos.wub-sub ; label: Wub Sub ; domain: music ; category: wubs (shown as Wubs)
  purpose: the clean low end under a wobble — a mono sub that never wobbles.
ports:
  in:  note_in · midi_in · mod.level (±1 → −1 silences, 0 = as set: duck it with Sidechain or Wub Rate unipolar−) ·
       note:trigger to any Wub Osc (observed when Follow is on)
  out: out (audio, mono content)
params: follow · wave [sine, triangle, warm] · octave −3..0 (default −1: the Wub Osc's own fundamental) · cut 40..400 Hz · glide · attack · release · level
behaviour:
  - follow: every note addressed to a Wub Osc plays here too (notes addressed to this sub arrive once, not twice)
  - mono, legato glide; velocity matters less than on a lead (0.25 + 0.75 · vel) so the floor stays solid
  - warm: an asymmetric soft curve adds 2nd/3rd harmonics so the sub is heard on small speakers; then Low-pass
packs: ships [factory] — 6 presets: Clean Sine · Warm Phone Sub · Triangle Punch · 808 Slide · Deep (an octave under) ·
  Own Notes (no follow)
acceptance (wub-sub.test.js): the tool contract · follows a note sent to a Wub Osc at octave −1 (A2 → 55 Hz, the Wub Osc's pitch) ·
  doesn't follow when Follow is off · a note sent to itself plays once · level mod −1 silences it

# ---- dependencies (generated by build/specs.mjs — do not edit by hand)
dependencies:
  mode: music   # Music Production
  toolbar_units: [music.engine, music.meter, music.midi]   # ui expansion when added: Audio engine · Master meter · MIDI button
  services:
    - audio: Audio engine — makes sound
    - midi: MIDI input — plays from a controller (arm with the MIDI button)
    - mod: 1 modulation input — LFO / XY / Macro can move them
    - notes: Notes from a sequencer, timeline or keys — or play its own keyboard
  inputs:
    - wubs.hook.note_in (note:trigger)
    - wubs.hook.midi_in (midi:note) — ambient broadcast
    - wubs.hook.mod_level (modulation · port mod.level)
  outputs:
    - wubs.hook.audio_out (audio · port out)
  permissions: [audio_out, midi_in, bus_publish, bus_subscribe, registry_read]
  works_with: [eravos.timeline, eravos.sequencer, eravos.midi-mapper, eravos.lyric-rhythm, eravos.ratio-lattice]
